OL,14,     FThe UK government has committed
OL,15,     F#100 million to speed up the
OL,16,     Frollout of robotic surgery in
OL,17,     FEngland. Laura Foster heads to the
OL,18,     Foperating theatre to see what it
OL,19,     Fmeans for patients.
